        "text": "This unit is always Empowered - you do not need to spend any Pain tokens to activate this unit's Pain abilities.",
        "points": 0
      },
      {
        "id": "darkglass_prism",
        "name": "Darkglass Prism",
        "text": "Each time this unit disembarks from a Transport, until the end of the turn, enemy units cannot use the Fire Overwatch Stratagem to shoot at this unit.",
        "points": 0
      },
      {
        "id": "fear_incarnate",
        "name": "Fear Incarnate",
        "text": "(Aura) While an enemy unit is within 6\" of this model, worsen the Leadership characteristic of models in that unit by 1. In addition, in the Battle-shock step of your opponent's Command phase, if such an enemy unit is below its Starting Strength, it must take a Battle-shock test.",
        "points": 0
      },
      {
        "id": "overwhelming_avarice",
        "name": "Overwhelming Avarice",
        "text": "While this model is leading a unit, each time a model in that unit makes a Pile-in or Consolidation move, it can move up to 6\" instead of up to 3\".",
        "points": 0
      },
      {
        "id": "sadistic_epicurean",
        "name": "Sadistic Epicurean",
        "text": "Each time an enemy unit is destroyed by this model's unit, gain 1 Pain token.",
        "points": 0
      },
      {
        "id": "storm_of_blades",
        "name": "Storm of Blades",
        "text": "While this model is leading a unit, melee weapons equipped by models in that unit have the [SUSTAINED HITS 1] ability.",
        "points": 0
      },
      {
        "id": "twisting_the_knife",
        "name": "Twisting the Knife",
        "text": "Each time this model makes an attack that targets a unit that is below its Starting Strength, you can re-roll the Hit roll. If that target is Below Half-strength, you can re-roll the Wound roll as well.",
        "points": 0
      }
